 * be reachable by normal `Emulated`-scoped CSS — was wrong, confirmed live
 * (Playwright DOM inspection: `.root` and the open panel's `.dropdown`/
 * `.option` carried two *different* `_ngcontent-*` attributes). So this
 * needs the same real, global, unscoped stylesheet treatment as
 * `menu-overlay.css`/`tooltip-overlay.css` — a consuming app imports it
 * once (see `SETUP.md`).
