 * stretching to fill the pane, so a short-labeled option list rendered a
 * panel far narrower than the trigger (same live-verified finding as
 * `auto-complete-overlay.css`'s own `.rec-autocomplete-panel`) — not a
 * missing panel-width *binding* (already wired), a missing *fill* rule on
 * the bound width's target.
