/*
 * Recursica DatePicker — global calendar-popup styling.
 *
 * `mat-datepicker`'s calendar (`MatDatepickerContent` → `MatCalendar` →
 * `MatMonthView`/`MatCalendarHeader`/`MatCalendarBody`) is genuinely
