 * is scoped under `.rec-autocomplete-panel` (applied directly in
 * `auto-complete-control.component.ts`'s template) and gated behind
 * `[data-recursica-theme]`.
 *
 * Panel-level tokens (background/border/radius) are `autocomplete`'s own;
 * per-option padding/icon/gap/selected-state tokens reuse `menu`/`menu-item`
